{"about_the_game":"Eleven Sunrises is an open world exploration and survival RPG/TOWER DEFENSE. This game is developed by Full Ideas Games independent company.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/6e201a79966bda9b141dc198f9d7eda1.poster.avif?t=1758216863\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/6e201a79966bda9b141dc198f9d7eda1.webm?t=1758216863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/6e201a79966bda9b141dc198f9d7eda1.mp4?t=1758216863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You wake up in a desert environment with no memories. The burning ruins are the aftermath of a great battle of which you are the only survivor.<br>Why are you here ?<br>Are there any other survivors?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore vast post-apocalyptic world</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/ed163230c5cb680db9e6a45181b3c35c.poster.avif?t=1758216863\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/ed163230c5cb680db9e6a45181b3c35c.webm?t=1758216863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/ed163230c5cb680db9e6a45181b3c35c.mp4?t=1758216863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore and conquer new territories. During this trip, you will find the food and weapons necessary for your survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect and use advanced bases to survive waves of enemies</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/256d958db85e9a9639b566ec59d69bca.avif?t=1758216863\" width=600 height=240 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fear the light - Fear the night</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/7a58bac84a039992f4bc6141f6787fb2.poster.avif?t=1758216863\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/7a58bac84a039992f4bc6141f6787fb2.webm?t=1758216863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/7a58bac84a039992f4bc6141f6787fb2.mp4?t=1758216863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A single energy, a single invincible enemy\u2026 the sun.<br>At nightfall, energy runs out and new predators appear.<br><br>How many sunrises will you survive?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel through different environments and unravel the mystery</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/49e021b0b174fb8dfead7af5f163a066.poster.avif?t=1758216863\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/49e021b0b174fb8dfead7af5f163a066.webm?t=1758216863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/49e021b0b174fb8dfead7af5f163a066.mp4?t=1758216863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2088590?t=1758216863","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/1a44a3431ba6c1b3886239bc7a4cc635e20c6f72/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758216863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app